{"4426660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drone Gunner", "steam_appid": 4426660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You do not fly the drone. You run its guns.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drone Gunner is a top-down tactical defense shooter where ammo is scarce and mistakes are expensive. Identify priority threats, take shots in short windows, and stay effective under enemy countermeasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are the weapons operator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is simple and brutal: keep the drone combat-ready and make every round count. This is not a spray-and-pray shooter - it is target selection, timing, and discipline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan the battlefield and pick the targets that actually matter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait for the opening - many threats only expose themselves briefly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend ammo like a resource, not a reflex</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handle enemy disruption that punishes sloppy play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426660/extras/a276df69df70a8252827c65d20825603.poster.avif?t=1775163753\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426660/extras/a276df69df70a8252827c65d20825603.webm?t=1775163753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426660/extras/a276df69df70a8252827c65d20825603.mp4?t=1775163753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p 